{"product_id":"mr-gum-and-the-power-crystals","title":"Mr Gum and the Power Crystals","description":"\u003cp\u003eAbout the AuthorAndy Stanton and David Tazzyman are the author and illustrator of the Mr Gum series..Product DescriptionIt's hard to believe these books can get any funnier, but readers will be guffawing with glee as they read the fourth book about Mr Gum's evil escapadesCan it really be true that there's an ancient curse on the town of Lamonic Bibber? And you guessed it, that old Mr Gum and his trusty sidekick Billy William the Third have something to do with it. But our favorite heroes Polly and Friday and the gingerbread biscuit Alan Taylor (only 6 inches tall) are determined to save the town (sigh of relief). Hang on to your heads and prepare to chuckle like a chipmunk as you are whisked to the land of talking dogs, silly songs, Old Granny, and the best chase scene you've ever seen. You may even learn to say \"The truth is a lemon meringue\" in Spanish!\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 159 x 254\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Andy Stanton\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781405228176\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 208\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45675015045273,"sku":"1RA9781405228176","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ab4f5bc1b21_Mr_Gum_and_the_Power_Crystals_Andy_Stanton.jpg?v=1756278790","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/mr-gum-and-the-power-crystals","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}